  "ingredients": [
    "2 pounds carrots, peeled and cut into sticks",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "0.25 cup packed brown sugar",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.125 teaspoon ground white pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dJJJ3yxaNCN0_8Jx8YUjP69XrYI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229669-glazed-carrots-DDMFS-step-01-124-d8c203dcf57345cfb8702dc1f6988773.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229669/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place carrots into a large saucepan; pour in enough water to reach depth of 1 inch and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer carrots until tender, 8 to 10 minutes. Drain and transfer to a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8KGzp9EFo-8dXsdfnycyAcTtfYw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229669-glazed-carrots-DDMFS-step-03-141-26a78f65a4e94b788e99a24597ea278a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229669/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in the same saucepan over low heat. Stir in brown sugar, salt, and white pepper until dissolved.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2d3L5Me8N1oU3l6r0qEZ8Lfw3OE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229669-glazed-carrots-DDMFS-step-06-144-42a117106f754e3c815308ac431aeb9b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229669/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add carrots to the saucepan and toss until coated in the brown sugar mixture. Cook and stir until carrots are heated through and fully coated with glaze, 1 to 3 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tWmChO9orrt_5arz8JhQPauIqsM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229669-glazed-carrots-DDMFS-step-07-145-0469a5dd695b4e9eb62f6d811a094f06.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229669/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ikpFtPB4bhgZ7j2l-3Tem2yzdH8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229669-glazed-carrots-DDMFS-4x3-151-83cd27fa77bd459a8aad877174f1db8f.jpg"
      ],
